sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as End User
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant App as FireFly App
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant DBX as Databricks

    Note over User,DBX: Phase 1: SSO Authentication (User Identity)

    User->>Browser: Navigate to /sso-spn/login
    Browser->>App: GET /sso-spn/login
    App->>Auth: Check session
    Auth-->>App: No session
    App-->>Browser: Show login page

    User->>Browser: Click "Sign in with SSO"
    Browser->>Auth: Initiate OAuth
    Auth->>Auth: Generate state + PKCE
    Auth-->>Browser: Redirect to Okta

    Browser->>Okta: Authorize request
    User->>Okta: Enter credentials
    Okta->>Okta: Authenticate user
    Okta-->>Browser: Redirect with auth code

    Browser->>Auth: Callback with code
    Auth->>Okta: Exchange code for tokens
    Okta-->>Auth: Access token + ID token

    Auth->>Auth: Extract user info
    Auth->>DB: Upsert user record
    Auth->>DB: Create session
    Auth-->>Browser: Set session cookie

    Note over User,DBX: Phase 2: Organization Selection (Context)

    Browser->>App: GET /sso-spn/select-org
    App->>DB: Get user memberships
    DB-->>App: List of organizations
    App-->>Browser: Display org selector

    User->>Browser: Select organization
    Browser->>App: POST /api/oauth/set-org
    App->>DB: Verify membership
    App->>DB: UPDATE session SET activeOrganizationId
    App-->>Browser: Redirect to dashboard

    Note over User,DBX: Phase 3: Databricks API Access (via SPN)

    Browser->>App: Request Databricks data
    App->>DB: Get org SPN credentials
    DB-->>App: clientId + clientSecret

    App->>DBX: POST /oidc/v1/token
    Note right of App: client_credentials grant
    DBX-->>App: SPN access token

    App->>App: Cache token
    App->>DBX: API call with Bearer token
    DBX-->>App: Data response
    App-->>Browser: Rendered data
